<title>UK: UK extends time for MMC study of Cowie buy.</title>
<headline>UK extends time for MMC study of Cowie buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain said on Thursday it granted a time extension for the Monopolies and Mergers Commission's report on Cowie Group Plc's acquisition of British Bus Ltd.</p>
<p>The Department of Trade and Industry said the reporting period would be extended to February 20.</p>
<p>The MMC had previously been asked to report on February 6.</p>
<p>In June of last year, Cowie, a vehicle and leasing bus firm, unveiled an agreed 282.3 million stg offer for British Bus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
